BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Reading Challenge Book Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260824T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260824T190000
UID:6a1e0dcc490f176f7dd7208f@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to Locke's Book Club\, where we will explore titles f
 rom categories of the\n2026 Reading Challenge\n.\nConnect with other read
 ers\, dive deeper into this year's categories through meaningful discussio
 n\, and learn about titles and formats you may not normally read. Each Boo
 k Club session will be facilitated by our staff\, who will provide a list 
 of titles you can choose for each month\, based on a category from TPL's 
 2026 Reading Challenge.\nCategory for July: Musician\nInformation Collecti
 on Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Toro
 nto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)
 \, and 20(d). The information will only be used for event and program regi
 stration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about how the library handle
 s your information can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.
 ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Locke\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a1e0dcc490f176f7dd7208f
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Young Adults
END:VEVENT
