DESCRIPTION:The 'A(i)\, B\, C's of AI literacy - the literacy AI show' (20
 25/26) is a 90 minute\, dynamic performance/presentation hosted by Keith M
 cDonald\, founder and Chief Curator of Toronto’s “the literacy AI proj
 ect”. Keith covers four specific must knows for becoming AI literate in 
